<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal has &quot;good chance&quot; to join euro launch-Min.</title>
<headline>Portugal has &quot;good chance&quot; to join euro launch-Min.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Finance Minister Antonio Sousa Franco said he believed Portugal had a good chance of joining the first stage of Economic and Monetary Union.  </p>
<p>&quot;We think Portugal has good chances (of joining the euro at the launch),&quot; Sousa Franco told Reuters Financial Television (RFTV) at a conference on Economic and Monetary Union in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>&quot;We are going to fulfil (Maastricht) criteria concerning the budget. The escudo is a stable currency. The public debt will be reduced for the second consecutive year. And inflation will also meet the criteria,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
